--[[
    ================================================================
      NEBULA HUB  -  Rainbow Pixel Liquid-Glass Hub  (single script)
    ================================================================
      Put this in StarterPlayer > StarterPlayerScripts as a
      LocalScript (works in Roblox Studio Play-test), or run it
      through your executor.

      FEATURES
        - Rainbow / glowy pixel-font UI, wobbling text, smooth drag,
          clean tween animations + click sounds.
        - Touch a wall with Transparency > 0.1  -> you get flung and
          phase (noclip) straight through it.  [Q] also flings manually.
        - Teleport Walk locked to 2 studs.
        - "Backward TP" toggle: hops you back 3.00-3.50 studs every
          2.0-3.0 seconds.
        - "Show Steals in Discord" toggle + gear -> settings window with
          "Keep Roblox user anonymous" / "Keep Discord user anonymous".
        - "Prompt re-work FF" slider (12,000 - 472,000, default 212,200).
        - Bottom-left character ViewportFrame with display name (bold
          blue) and @username (italic white).
        - Rainbow glowing base beam kept as a visual.

      NOTES
        - Discord: Roblox blocks direct webhook posts to discord.com via
          HttpService. Put YOUR webhook (or a proxy URL) in CONFIG.Webhook
          and enable HttpService. Hook reportSteal() to your game's real
          steal event (see the commented example near the bottom).
        - Click sound / beam texture are plain asset ids - swap freely.
    ================================================================
]]

